flowchart LR
    original[Successful answer or extraction run] --> prepare[Restore pinned source revisions and canonical target]
    prepare --> hash[Pin input_run_id and input_hash]
    hash --> ready[Critic pipeline prepared]
    ready --> reserve[Atomic attempt reservation with expected_version]
    reserve --> model[One critic model call]
    model --> validate[Schema, complete item coverage and exact quotes]
    validate --> saved[Durable critic run]
    saved --> packet[Local review packet and computed verdict]
    packet --> human[Human review still required]
    saved --> recovery[Resume uses saved success without model replay]
    recovery --> packet
    ready --> changed[Changed input hash blocks execution]
    reserve --> unknown[Unknown outcome blocks automatic retry]
